# Feishu Integration Developer — Tools & Skills

## Required Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Read | Read API documentation, existing integration code, configuration files, and Feishu SDK source |
| Edit | Modify integration modules, update token management, and refine event handlers |
